Those wounds need to be treated.

261
00:17:04,540 --> 00:17:08,364
Why don't you come with me to my
house and I'll fix you up, okay?

262
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,120
Should I go?

263
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:16,157
If I don't defeat the stand user,
I won't turn back into an adult.

264
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:20,437
If the past is any indication, he
won't attack me with this lady around.

265
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:22,814
I can use that time to think of a plan.

266
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,360
Come on, hurry up. Whoa!

267
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,440
Oh, that's right.

268
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:33,802
You're hurt, so climb on my back,
but make sure you hang on tight.

269
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,660
She smells good.

270
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:49,820
This hurts like a bitch!

271
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,140
Damn that little crotch sniffer!

272
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:56,282
I'm not going to take this
from a snot-nosed kid.

273
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:58,140
He'll pay dearly for this.

274
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,264
I swear I'll butcher that brat!

275
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:19,025
From the looks of things, he
doesn't seem to be coming after me.

276
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:20,560
All right, little boy,

277
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:24,257
we're going to take a bath, so let's
take those clothes off, shall we?

278
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,177
You're completely covered in grime.

279
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:29,554
I'll clean those wounds up
and put some medicine on you.

280
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,421
What are you staring at, sweetie?

281
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:47,134
Take your clothes off.

282
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:49,734
Better yet, I'll take them off for you.

283
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,420
Here, raise your leg.

284
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:52,810
Hey, wait!

285
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:54,580
What are you doing, lady?

286
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,300
But what's wrong?

287
00:18:57,720 --> 00:18:58,860
Nothing at all.

288
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,620
No, it is something.

289
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,900
It most definitely is something.

290
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:06,440
I don't know why,

291
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:10,854
but I get the feeling that I should
be really embarrassed about all this.

292
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,720
Wait, oh no.

293
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,660
What if my...

294
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:17,120
It's so small.

295
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:20,634
I don't know why, but for
some reason that makes me sad.

296
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,820
Hey, don't cry. Why?

297
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:27,438
After we get all that dirt off of
you, you'll be as good as new again.

298
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,100
Here, lift your leg.

299
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,070
I... I...

300
00:19:39,153 --> 00:19:40,540
I'm so happy!

301
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:44,577
Are you positive it's okay
for me to touch you like this?

302
00:19:44,660 --> 00:19:46,260
Of course it's okay, silly.

303
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:49,931
If we don't clean up those
wounds, they could get infected.

304
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:52,278
You've got dirt on your wee-wee too.

305
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:56,580
Oh, boy.

306
00:19:56,820 --> 00:20:00,257
I can't explain why, but I'm
just so happy all of a sudden.

307
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:02,516
I guess it's all part of being a kid.

308
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,080
All right.

309
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,772
You be a good boy, okay?

310
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:14,050
Okay!

311
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:23,620
The fool's delirious.

312
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:28,440
Enjoy your stupor while you can, because
I'm going to chop your face in tow!

313
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:49,224
What could you be grinning
about, you silly boy?

314
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:52,440
Now, I think it's time
we wash your hair. Huh?

315
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,340
I hate using shampoo!

316
00:20:57,780 --> 00:20:59,157
It gets into my eyes and I hate it!

317
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,757
Rock, paper, scissors, go!

318
00:21:05,420 --> 00:21:06,600
Monkey, monkey, do!

319
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,860
Oh, I lost!

320
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,280
Alright, sit still!

321
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:23,577
Does it sting?

322
00:21:23,660 --> 00:21:26,077
Yeah, it stings a lot.

323
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:29,957
Can you wash your hair
all by yourself? Uh-huh.

324
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:31,797
But not as good as you.

325
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:34,940
Oh, attaboy.

326
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:42,660
Yes!

327
00:21:43,020 --> 00:21:44,314
That's the way, kiddo!

328
00:21:44,520 --> 00:21:45,760
Atta boy!

329
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:49,180
That's impossible!

330
00:22:12,660 --> 00:22:14,360
Thank you.

331
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:41,020
Thank you.

332
00:23:05,040 --> 00:23:06,497
To be

333
00:23:06,580 --> 00:23:13,580
continued...

334
00:23:35,860 --> 00:23:38,160
I don't see that nice lady anywhere.

335
00:23:38,380 --> 00:23:40,140
Come on, you that stupid?
